tale","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Sarah Hanson-Young","party":"Greens","person_id":"tvfy_10711","person_slug":"sarah-hanson-young","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Scott Ryan","party":"PRES","person_id":"tvfy_10715","person_slug":"scott-ryan","vote":"no"},{"name":"Steve Martin","party":"Independent","person_id":"tvfy_10905","person_slug":"steve-martin","vote":"no"},{"name":"Stirling Griff","party":"Centre Alliance","person_id":"tvfy_10851","person_slug":"stirling-griff","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Sue Lines","party":"PRES","person_id":"tvfy_10782","person_slug":"sue-lines","vote":"no"}],"name":"Motions - Kangaroos - Make data available","noes":44,"question":"The majority voted against this [motion](https://www.openaustralia.org.au/senate/?id=2018-02-14.202.2), which means it failed. ### Motion text > *That the Senate—* > *(a) notes that:* >> *(i) Australian Government management of kangaroos tends to be structured to service commercial shooting and farming industries,* >> *(ii) in 2015, between 65 000 and 650 000 kangaroos suffered non-lethal body-shots and a further 110 000 joeys died from commercial shooting alone, with pouch joeys decapitated or their skulls crushed,* >> *(iii) kangaroos are slow-growing and are shot beyond their low reproductive capacity, with long-term government raw data illustrating kangaroo absence and decline, yet this is not reflected in the published population estimates from which an impossibly high commercial shooting quota is extracted, and* >> *(iv) kangaroo is a wild-shot bushmeat and is butchered and transported on open unrefrigerated trucks in the field and, in 2014, Russia banned kangaroo meat imports for a third time due to contamination, with rapid food security alerts in the European Union about kangaroo meat since then; and* > *(b) calls on the Commonwealth and all states to make available all historical and current kangaroo survey data and methodologies, and commercial and non-commercial shooting and demographics data for all shooting zones across Australia.*","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-5135","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2018-02-14/5"}
